`multiStep_alloc_storeLoad_retag_frameExit_dealloc_realloc_lifecycle` on this run: it discharges the
`DeallocLockstepEnv` hypotheses for BOTH verdicts (`.protectedDealloc` at `st3`, `.ok` at `st4`) under
